# Per-project build output directories (Release, ReleaseU*, Release_*,
# Debug, DebugU, busmaster_debug). Note: Sources\BUSMASTER\BIN\Release and
# BIN\Debug also contain vendor runtime DLLs that are tracked in git; those
# stay tracked regardless, but newly vendored binaries there need
# `git add -f`.
Sources/**/Release*/
Sources/**/Debug*/
Sources/**/busmaster_debug/

